data: {"type":"text-delta","id":"answer","delta":"[MOCK] VIP\nPersonal cameraman and edited film\nIncluded\nTandem skydive experience in Pattaya, Thailand\nSafety briefing and tandem instructor support\nAircraft ascent and ocean-view jump experience\nCertificate of completion\n฿14,000 per person\nWhich package should I choose?\nChoose ECO for the standard jump, Deluxe if you want handy cam video, and VIP if you want full media coverage.\nIf the activity is stopped part-way\nIf an aircraft turns back, a dive is aborted or a lift closes after you have started, the operator will either re-run the activity when conditions allow or refund the portion you did not receive.\nOn a multi-dive or multi-jump package, days already completed are not refunded — the days you did not get are.\nIf we or the operator cancel\nIf we cancel for any reason other than weather or safety — a schedule change, an aircraft out of service, a course that does not fill — you choose between a full refund and an alternative date. Where the alternative costs more, we cover the difference.\nWe will never quietly move you onto a different package. Any change is offered, not applied.\nHow refunds are paid\nBecause payment is taken by the operator on the day, most cancellations involve nothing to refund — there is simply nothing to pay.\nWhere a deposit has been paid, it is returned by the same method it was sent, normally within 7 working days of the cancellation being confirmed. Any bank or transfer fee charged by your own bank is outside our control."}

